#### 4. Mystery Guest
**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 145)
```csharp
File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv")
```
**Risk:** Hard-coded absolute Windows path. Fails on any machine that doesn't have this file at this exact location — Linux CI, teammate's laptop, etc. The test depends on an invisible external resource whose contents are unknown to the reader.
**Fix:** Inline the test data or use an embedded resource:
```csharp
[TestMethod]
public void ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    var csvContent = "SKU,Qty\nSKU-1,2\nSKU-2,1\nSKU-3,3\nSKU-4,1\nSKU-5,2";

    var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csvContent);

    Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
}
```

